    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so is there like a specific part of the brain or a nerve that's doing the heavy lifting? i heard something about the vagus nerve being involved in regulating the heart rate and stuff during breathing exercises. how does the physical act of holding the breath specifically trigger that?",
